{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128214603258-1128_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261128215321\"/><p>警員拘捕男司機，並且出動緝毒犬搜車。(余宏基攝)</p><p>油麻地截獲懷疑毒品快餐車，今晚(28日)8時17分，警員巡經麗翔道時，發現一輛客貨車有可疑，其後在接近巧翔街交界截停對方調查。據悉，經搜查後，警員在車內搜出5包懷疑大麻，當場拘捕一名男司機，暫時不清楚涉案毒品數量及市值。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T14:19:46.281465+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T13:46:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:12:59.435588+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T14:12:59.435588+00:00","content_hash":"939acdc6262551126d0856615e30835495eaa87c88cb6ea420b4fedae3a5eaf5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}